
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Player Registration | PPGP CUP Season 5</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{
 background:#061711;color:#f5f8ef;
 font-family:Inter,sans-serif;padding:35px 15px;
}
.container{max-width:850px;margin:auto}
.back{color:#baff43;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}
.heading{text-align:center;margin:35px 0}
.heading small{color:#baff43;letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:900}
.heading h1{font:900 clamp(48px,9vw,75px)/1 "Barlow Condensed";margin:12px 0}
.heading p{color:#a7b8aa;font-size:12px}
.form-card{
 background:linear-gradient(145deg,#123527,#091f16);
 border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
 padding:35px;border-radius:17px;
 box-shadow:0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
}
.section-title{
 color:#baff43;font:800 25px "Barlow Condensed";
 margin:25px 0 18px;
 border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
 padding-bottom:10px;
}
.section-title:first-child{margin-top:0}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.field.full{grid-column:1/-1}
label{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#d5e1d6}
input,select,textarea{
 width:100%;padding:14px;
 border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
 border-radius:7px;background:#071b14;
 color:white;font:12px Inter;outline:none;
}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:#baff43}
input[type=file]{padding:11px}
option{background:#071b14}
.submit{
 width:100%;margin-top:28px;padding:17px;
 background:#baff43;color:#102016;border:0;
 border-radius:7px;font-weight:900;
 letter-spacing:1px;cursor:pointer;transition:.3s;
}
.submit:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 12px 30px #baff4330}
.note{font-size:10px;color:#a7b8aa;line-height:1.7;margin-top:15px}
@media(max-width:600px){
 .form-card{padding:22px 16px}
 .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .field.full{grid-column:auto}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<a class="back" href="/">← BACK TO HOME</a>

<div class="heading">
<small>ODISHA TENNIS CRICKET</small>
<h1>PLAYER <span style="color:#baff43">REGISTRATION</span></h1>
<p>PPGP CUP · SEASON 5 · JOIN THE CHAMPIONSHIP</p>
</div>

<div class="form-card">
<form action="/register" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">

<h2 class="section-title">01 — PERSONAL DETAILS</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="field">
<label>PLAYER FULL NAME *</label>
<input name="fullName" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Enter your full name">
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>PHONE NUMBER *</label>
<input name="phone" type="tel" required pattern="[0-9]{10}" maxlength="10" placeholder="10 digit mobile number">
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>DATE OF BIRTH *</label>
<input name="dateOfBirth" type="date" required>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>VILLAGE / CITY *</label>
<input name="city" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Your village or city">
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>DISTRICT *</label>
<select name="district" required>
<option value="">Select district</option>
<option>Angul</option><option>Balangir</option><option>Balasore</option>
<option>Bargarh</option><option>Bhadrak</option><option>Boudh</option>
<option>Cuttack</option><option>Deogarh</option><option>Dhenkanal</option>
<option>Gajapati</option><option>Ganjam</option><option>Jagatsinghpur</option>
<option>Jajpur</option><option>Jharsuguda</option><option>Kalahandi</option>
<option>Kandhamal</option><option>Kendrapara</option><option>Keonjhar</option>
<option>Khordha</option><option>Koraput</option><option>Malkangiri</option>
<option>Mayurbhanj</option><option>Nabarangpur</option><option>Nayagarh</option>
<option>Nuapada</option><option>Puri</option><option>Rayagada</option>
<option>Sambalpur</option><option>Subarnapur</option><option>Sundargarh</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>JERSEY NUMBER</label>
<input name="jerseyNumber" type="number" min="0" max="99" placeholder="e.g. 07">
</div>
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">02 — CRICKET DETAILS</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="field">
<label>PLAYER ROLE *</label>
<select name="role" required>
<option value="">Select role</option>
<option>Batsman</option>
<option>Bowler</option>
<option>All-Rounder</option>
<option>Wicket Keeper</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>BATTING STYLE</label>
<select name="battingStyle">
<option value="">Select batting style</option>
<option>Right Hand</option>
<option>Left Hand</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>BOWLING STYLE</label>
<select name="bowlingStyle">
<option value="">Select bowling style</option>
<option>Right Arm Fast</option>
<option>Left Arm Fast</option>
<option>Right Arm Spin</option>
<option>Left Arm Spin</option>
<option>Not Applicable</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>TEAM NAME</label>
<input name="teamName" maxlength="80" placeholder="Team name (if known)">
</div>
<div class="field full">
<label>PLAYER PHOTO</label>
<input type="file" name="playerPhoto" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp">
</div>
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">03 — CONFIRMATION</h2>
<div class="field">
<label>
<input type="checkbox" name="declaration" value="yes" required style="width:auto;margin-right:8px">
I confirm that the information provided is correct.
</label>
</div>

<button class="submit" type="submit">SUBMIT PLAYER REGISTRATION ↗</button>
<p class="note">Your registration will be stored securely. Registration approval and team allocation will be handled according to tournament rules.</p>
</form>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
